{# The masthead — the app's header bar, in email-safe form (operator 2026-10-05: "the top of the
   email should look more or less like the top of my app"). Same lockup as App.vue's desktop header:
   the waveform mark (36px), the tagline as a mono kicker above the wordmark (24px, extra-bold,
   system font — the app's display font IS the system font), and a divider under the bar.
   Colours are the app's tokens (theme/tokens.css): muted #acb2c2, cream #f0eae0, border #1e2739.

   The mark is a PNG, not the app's SVG: Gmail and Outlook do not render SVG. Served by the player
   at `/brand/email-mark.png` (3x for retina) from the tenant's own origin — a static .png passes
   the pre-launch gate. `alt=""` because the wordmark beside it is REAL TEXT: a client that blocks
   images still shows "Close Listening", which an image-only logo would lose. #}
{# The inbox preview line (operator 2026-10-05): what a mail list shows under the subject. Each
   template sets `preheader`; hidden here, first in the body, padded so the rest of the email does
   not leak into the preview after it. #}
{% if preheader is defined and preheader %}<div style="display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#080d1b;opacity:0;">{{ preheader }}{% for _ in range(40) %}&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #1e2739;margin:0 0 24px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;">
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
      <tr>
        <td valign="middle" style="padding:0 12px 0 0;"><img src="{{ app_origin }}/brand/email-mark.png" width="34" height="36" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;"></td>
        <td valign="middle">
          <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#acb2c2;line-height:1.3;">Listen. Understand. Remember.</div>
          <div style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#f0eae0;line-height:1.15;">Close Listening</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
